D2A2 5D               (    forth6809.asm):03537                     TSTB
D2A3 10270011         (    forth6809.asm):03538                     LBEQ  TRYNUM
                      (    forth6809.asm):03539         
D2A7 9601             (    forth6809.asm):03540                     LDA   STATE+1
