DA43 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05028                     PSHU  D
DA45 BDD8CA           (    forth6809.asm):05029                     JSR   PATCH
DA48 3264             (    forth6809.asm):05030                     LEAS  4,S               ; drop the frame
DA4A 39               (    forth6809.asm):05031                     RTS
