FFAD 6F80             (    forth6809.asm):11032         CLRGLOB:    CLR   ,X+
FFAF 5A               (    forth6809.asm):11033                     DECB
FFB0 26FB             (    forth6809.asm):11034                     BNE   CLRGLOB
                      (    forth6809.asm):11035         
